  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the post of Guest Teacher in Primary, Junior, Middle and High School Level. The online application process for MP Guest Teacher Online Form 2026 has started on 02 May 2026, and candidates can apply till 11 May 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for MP Guest Teacher Online Form 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Madhya Pradesh Guest Faculty Management System (GFMS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">MP Guest Teacher Online Form 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>29 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>02 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">No Application Fees For All Candidates</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MP Guest Teacher Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per MP Guest Teacher Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MP Guest Teacher 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : NA</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Guest Teacher</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">NA</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>MP Guest Teacher Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"157\">Graduation (Bachelor’s Degree) or an equivalent examination</strong>&nbsp;from a recognized university.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"598\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BED / BTC Exam Passed</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"598\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MPTET 2018 OR Later</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MP Guest Teacher Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://hpsc.gov.in or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the GFMS before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for MP Guest Teacher online form can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MP Guest Teacher Recruitment 2026 : Required Documents</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhaar Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mobile Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Email ID</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passport Size Photograph</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Signature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Educational Certificates</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.Ed / D.El.Ed Certificates</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Experience Certificate (if available)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Identity Proof</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" styl